                <mxCell id="am_note" value="fabric_addr_map (axi_pkg::xbar_rule_32_t):&#xa;[0] RAM:   RamBaseAddr   .. +RamSize     (0x80000000)&#xa;[1] UART:  UartBaseAddr  .. +UartSize    (0x10000000)&#xa;[2] DEBUG: DebugBaseAddr .. +DebugSize   (e.g. 0x00000000 in ROM-select)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="540" width="780" height="100" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="checker_note2" value="AXI protocol checkers (sim only):&#xa;- one soc_axi_protocol_checker on each core_axi_req[i] (input to arbiter)&#xa;- one on the merged fabric_axi_req (arbiter -&gt; demux)&#xa;- one on each target_axi_req[i] (demux outputs)&#xa;Single-beat invariants: len == 0, w.last == 1, payload stable while valid &amp;&amp; !ready.&#xa;&#xa;CVA6 mode (CoreType = CORE_CVA6): replaces RV32 instr/data OBI bridges with corejack_cva6_axi_adapter; AXI[1] is tied to '0 (no second initiator)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;dashed=1" parent="1" vertex="1">
